OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Stan Tracey
OL,6,     F4/5. Kate Molleson is joined by
OL,7,     FClark Tracey to explore the life
OL,8,     Fand work of his father, pianist
OL,9,     Fand composer Stan Tracey. Today, a
OL,10,     Fturn towards large-scale suites.
OL,11,G1700 In Tune
OL,12,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents live
OL,13,     Fmusic from The Carice Singers.
OL,14,     FViolinist Francesca Dego and
OL,15,     Fpianist Francesca Leonardi play
OL,16,     Flive ahead of their Wigmore Hall
OL,17,     Frecital.
